    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n471" root="ادى" body-key="A">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استأداهُ مَالًا</span></b>  <i>He desired,</i> or <i>sought, to obtain
from him property,</i> or <i>sued,</i> or <i>prosecuted, him
for it,</i> or <i>demanded it of him,</i> (S, K,) <i>and
extracted it,</i> (S,) or <i>took it,</i> or <i>received it,</i> (K,)
<i>from him.</i> (S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ادو</span>.

